[{"comment_id": "7644884004328375089", "create_time": 1779963264, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7644826702106856767", "content": "这是pocket4p拍的？？？这么清晰吗？", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "62", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAq-_7_hH06C-DWfV5Mrkj0cKNLvA2V5q2Y1REjzq6RPc", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAq-_7_hH06C-DWfV5Mrkj0cKNLvA2V5q2Y1REjzq6RPc", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1459000532", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "🐶犬栗崽", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_o8CjATjbsiDAoACAE1iB4afvIAnPwbxhEoYUXe.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "4", "last_modify_ts": 1794420512333}, {"comment_id": "7649368485638898468", "create_time": 1781007389, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7644826702106856767", "content": "响屐舞是中国古代舞蹈的经典之作，它见证了吴越争霸的历史，也见证了中国古代文化的发展和演变。舞蹈中的每一个动作、每一个眼神，都蕴含着历史的沧桑和文化的底蕴，象征着中国古代文化的博大精深和源远流长。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "58", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAsd3ussrXKqSLKcTsfW26E-4_77MCCnTUeVG48wD2pUE", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAsd3ussrXKqSLKcTsfW26E-4_77MCCnTUeVG48wD2pUE", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1339495607A", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "静默情感", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_oQAAGyEIEAgq8Cbfw7FNsvBGGv7f0AADDCO9An.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420512333}, {"comment_id": "7644929779377111845", "create_time": 1779973922, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7644826702106856767", "content": "听到木屐响的那一刻脑子里突然冒出来一句话：“这一脚一脚踩碎了她的一生，剁碎了她的骨头”", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "70", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA7_hHhg30dCkZrAnKhvhVAUk7cKs1rJKEKKhuMC4ndAs", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA7_hHhg30dCkZrAnKhvhVAUk7cKs1rJKEKKhuMC4ndAs", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "154554306", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "雨桐", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_okQn8CzXPASAzB5pIAAnDb40CfNFmQAL5Ae9gl.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420512333}, {"comment_id": "7653633406760747811", "create_time": 1782000394, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7644826702106856767", "content": "西施本是苎罗村的浣衣女，在范蠡的劝说下，被献给吴王为妃，吴王逐渐荒废政事，在西施的努力下越王才得回归越国，西施是一位忠君爱国，有勇有谋的女子", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "449", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAF68d7hUPCrxXYimSP5W2PFrrKuDi9mR0GOK_XionmI8", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAF68d7hUPCrxXYimSP5W2PFrrKuDi9mR0GOK_XionmI8", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "1873763359", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "焕焕", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c001_oADvIEOfDMAe2MAHAdXpB7OAABaAeEuGQw8MZQ.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "1", "last_modify_ts": 1794420512333}, {"comment_id": "7645273095302267698", "create_time": 1780054296, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7644826702106856767", "content": "从苎萝山下的浣纱女到吴宫深处的权谋局，她以轻笑破万难，以柔肩担大义。弱质非怯，是隐忍的锋芒；陷虎狼不惧，是家国的信仰。这舞，是西施的史诗，也是每个中国人骨子里的坚韧。点赞，为这份柔中带刚的中国力量！# 舞蹈诗剧西施 #大疆 Pocket4P #濮院时尚古镇", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "145", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAZrfFAhefUqeqxdy2TCIpsbos1qN5KFSUi5P6AiTzm25zkvY47UUbh-YWO_hmIot_", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAZrfFAhefUqeqxdy2TCIpsbos1qN5KFSUi5P6AiTzm25zkvY47UUbh-YWO_hmIot_", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "30093079588", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "用户6825050420542", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/aweme_default_avatar.png.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420512333}, {"comment_id": "7644924330926097189", "create_time": 1779972653, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7644826702106856767", "content": "这不是日本的，早在唐朝，李白的诗中就有“脚着谢公屐，身登青云梯”，说的就是脚上的木屐，是南朝诗人谢灵运发明的木屐", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "89", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAArTmlcQpdo4C-MoAHYyV__zMgN-GVr-gUKYiDhpVrEFBZAcEdNiUgKQbHpdlpoZWr", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAArTmlcQpdo4C-MoAHYyV__zMgN-GVr-gUKYiDhpVrEFBZAcEdNiUgKQbHpdlpoZWr", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "071001lovett", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "下雪时想起你", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_ooLmxAASUDJfWHQ2EqFEg2DIBeA72AAQIpf480.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "0", "last_modify_ts": 1794420512333}, {"comment_id": "7645163892465320739", "create_time": 1780028431, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7644826702106856767", "content": "西施其实是门客报恩。我一直以来都这么觉得的", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": true, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "5413", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAvlOcdqy7n5VlxqJ_o9ql1r0RCJafg0MS0rbsEFQFvFs", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAvlOcdqy7n5VlxqJ_o9ql1r0RCJafg0MS0rbsEFQFvFs", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "qiwen10241112", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "菩萨蛮", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813_oIO6DfzNAEDDQxBrjAqgFCbRIe9IAAGWHApAhV.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "12", "last_modify_ts": 1794420512333}, {"comment_id": "7644971540606845702", "create_time": 1779983646, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7644826702106856767", "content": "天啊！谁懂木屐鞋敲响地板震撼心灵的那种感觉！让人感受到了女性对待家国的一种坚定情怀，期待作品！让更多人知道木屐鞋并不是源自于小日本的！！！而是我们的文化！！！", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "161", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAA_CzgqqIFZ0xX81FiliIGYgzuS3o2lVsjLUOuZPeqRFL_POg6fV7CG65182hzn40l", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAA_CzgqqIFZ0xX81FiliIGYgzuS3o2lVsjLUOuZPeqRFL_POg6fV7CG65182hzn40l", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "94214476878", "user_signature": "", "nickn